{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NECROMANCER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight an onslaught of terrifying enemies in this 90s FPS inspired arena shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is for fans of roguelikes, and quakelike movement shooters, and it even has a touch of action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather many different weapons with distinct purposes to annihilate your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the eldritch hellscape of the Necromancer's trial, and survive as long as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FLY LIKE A BOLT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391340/extras/zoomiesGif.gif?t=1743833677\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUILD YOUR ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391340/extras/WeaponsGif.gif?t=1743833677\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">INCARNATE YOUR ARMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391340/extras/ArmyGif.gif?t=1743833677\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAIN GODLY POWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391340/extras/powerup_gif.gif?t=1743833677\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVE AND ANNIHILATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391340/extras/GameplayGif.gif?t=1743833677\" /> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1391340?t=1743833677","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/image